@hostA = http://localhost:5107
@hostB = http://localhost:5099

### 1. Надіслати в ServerA
POST {{hostA}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "REC-772",
  "name": { "first": "Oleh", "last": "Kovalko" },
  "blood": { "group": "С", "rh": "+" },
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "allergies": [ { "substance": "Penicillin", "severity": "High" } ],
  "visits": [ { "date": "2023-09-10", "doctor": "Dr. House", "diagnosis": "Flu" } ]
}

### 2. XML із ServerB 
GET {{hostB}}/patients/REC-7732/xml
Accept: application/xml

### 3. Upsert
POST {{hostA}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "REC-7732",
  "name": { "first": "Oleh", "last": "Koval" },
  "blood": { "group": "A", "rh": "+" },
  "birthDate": "1985-12-31",
  "allergies": [
    { "substance": "Penicillin", "severity": "High" },
    { "substance": "Peanuts", "severity": "Medium" }
  ],
  "visits": [
    { "date": "2024-02-20", "doctor": "Dr. Wilson", "diagnosis": "Checkup" },
    { "date": "2023-09-10", "doctor": "Dr. House", "diagnosis": "Flu" }
  ]
}

### 4. XML після upsert
GET {{hostB}}/patients/REC-7732/xml
Accept: application/xml

### 5. Неіснуючий пацієнт 
GET {{hostB}}/patients/NOT-EXISTS/xml
Accept: application/xml

### 6. Прямий виклик ServerB
POST {{hostB}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "REC-9999",
  "name": { "first": "Test", "last": "Direct" },
  "blood": { "group": "AB", "rh": "+" },
  "birthDate": "1995-06-20",
  "allergies": [ { "substance": "Latex", "severity": "Low" } ],
  "visits": [ { "date": "2024-05-01", "doctor": "Dr. Grey", "diagnosis": "Cold" } ]
}
###7. GET всі 
GET {{hostA}}/patients


### 8.PUT
PUT {{hostA}}/patients/REC-7732
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "REC-7732",
  "name": { "first": "Oleh", "last": "Koval" },
  "blood": { "group": "B", "rh": "-" },
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "allergies": [],
  "visits": []
}

### 9.PATCH
PATCH {{hostA}}/patients/REC-7732
Content-Type: application/json

{ "blood": { "group": "O", "rh": "+" } }

###11. PATCH з помилкою валідації (очікується 400)
PATCH {{hostA}}/patients/REC-7732
Content-Type: application/json

{ "birthDate": "2090-01-01" }

###12. Перевірити XML після змін 
GET {{hostB}}/patients/REC-7732/xml

### 13.GET всі ServerB
GET {{hostB}}/patients

### 14.DELETE 
DELETE {{hostA}}/patients/REC-7732